---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Field Notes — GeoSmart" description="Field notes, geological explanations and learning notes from Camila Fernández on geology, Norway, subsurface and scientific curiosity.">
  <section class="page-hero notes-hero"><div class="notes-scribble" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div class="container"><div class="section-kicker">Geology · Norway · Learning</div><h1>Field Notes</h1><p class="muted">The curious side of GeoSmart: geological ideas, observations, explanations and lessons from learning to read the Earth.</p><div class="notes-compass" aria-hidden="true"><span>N</span><b>+</b><span>E</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="section field-notes-page"><div class="container field-notes-layout">
    <article class="note-feature note-article-card"><div class="note-number">FIELD NOTE 01</div><div class="note-meta"><span class="card-tag">Geophysics</span><span>·</span><span>First note</span></div><h2>Why does seismic interpretation actually matter?</h2><p class="lead">Seismic data is more than pretty lines on a screen. It is a way of asking geological questions about structures and histories we cannot see directly.</p><div class="article-teaser"><span>WHAT I'LL EXPLORE</span><p>Reflections · horizons · faults · geological reasoning · uncertainty</p></div><div class="note-footer"><span>Reading the subsurface</span><span>In preparation</span></div></article>
    <div class="note-list note-grid"><article class="note note-card note-green"><div class="note-index">02</div><div class="note-meta"><span class="card-tag">Norway</span><span>Field · Trondheim</span></div><h3>Geology in Trondheim</h3><p>What changes when you start looking at an everyday landscape with a geologist's eye — and what I am noticing around Trondheim.</p><div class="note-footer"><span>Landscape</span><span>In preparation</span></div></article><article class="note note-card note-orange"><div class="note-index">03</div><div class="note-meta"><span class="card-tag">Sedimentology</span><span>Learning</span></div><h3>Reading a sedimentary log</h3><p>How observations become a sedimentary interpretation, and why the geological story is rarely as simple as one neat answer.</p><div class="note-footer"><span>Earth history</span><span>In preparation</span></div></article><article class="note note-card note-ochre"><div class="note-index">04</div><div class="note-meta"><span class="card-tag">Energy</span><span>Subsurface</span></div><h3>What makes a good reservoir?</h3><p>Porosity, permeability and the geological history behind reservoir quality — without drowning in jargon.</p><div class="note-footer"><span>Reservoirs</span><span>In preparation</span></div></article><article class="note note-card note-cream"><div class="note-index">05</div><div class="note-meta"><span class="card-tag">Learning</span><span>Student life</span></div><h3>Things I wish I knew before studying geology</h3><p>Fieldwork, maps, software, mistakes and the gradual process of learning how to think like a geologist.</p><div class="note-footer"><span>Student geology</span><span>In preparation</span></div></article></div>
  </div></section>
  <section class="notes-bottom"><div class="container"><span class="section-kicker">Keep looking closer</span><p>Some rocks tell stories in layers. Some landscapes tell them in relief. These notes are my way of paying attention.</p><span class="geology-line" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.notes-hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#edf2eb 0%,#fffdf9 52%,#f6efe7 100%)}.notes-hero::after{content:'FIELD / NOTE / 01';position:absolute;right:5%;bottom:24%;writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:rgba(15,61,62,.22);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em}.notes-scribble{position:absolute;right:7%;bottom:12%;width:300px;height:120px;opacity:.25;transform:rotate(-8deg)}.notes-scribble span{position:absolute;inset:0;border-top:1px solid var(--green);border-radius:50%;transform:skewX(-18deg)}.notes-scribble span:nth-child(2){inset:20px 25px}.notes-scribble span:nth-child(3){inset:40px 55px;border-color:var(--orange)}.notes-compass{position:absolute;right:14%;top:24%;width:86px;height:86px;border:1px solid rgba(15,61,62,.18);border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--green);font-size:.6rem;letter-spacing:.15em;background:rgba(255,253,249,.35)}.notes-compass::before,.notes-compass::after{content:'';position:absolute;background:var(--orange)}.notes-compass::before{width:1px;height:112px}.notes-compass::after{height:1px;width:112px}.notes-compass b{font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;z-index:1}.notes-compass span{position:absolute}.notes-compass span:first-child{top:6px}.notes-compass span:last-child{bottom:6px}.note-article-card{position:relative;overflow:hidden;border-left:5px solid var(--orange);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fffdf9,#f4eadf)}.note-article-card::after{content:'01';position:absolute;right:18px;bottom:-25px;color:rgba(15,61,62,.06);font:700 8rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif}.note-number{color:var(--orange);font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-bottom:18px}.note-card{position:relative;padding-left:18px;border-left:4px solid var(--green);transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease;background:#fffdf9}.note-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px);box-shadow:0 18px 35px rgba(15,61,62,.1)}.note-green{border-left-color:var(--green)}.note-orange{border-left-color:var(--orange)}.note-ochre{border-left-color:#b69b55}.note-cream{border-left-color:#c97b55}.note-index{color:rgba(15,61,62,.18);font:600 2.3rem/1 'Playfair Display',serif;margin-bottom:9px}.note-orange .note-index{color:rgba(245,130,32,.45)}.note-ochre .note-index{color:rgba(182,155,85,.55)}.notes-bottom{padding:70px 0 85px;background:var(--green);border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden}.notes-bottom::after{content:'✦';position:absolute;right:10%;top:28px;color:rgba(245,130,32,.5);font-size:2rem}.notes-bottom p{max-width:720px;color:#fff7ee;font:500 clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.8rem)/1.2 'Playfair Display',serif;margin:14px 0 28px}.geology-line{display:block;width:100%;height:20px;background:linear-gradient(175deg,transparent 42%,var(--orange) 43% 46%,transparent 47% 60%,rgba(255,255,255,.35) 61% 63%,transparent 64%);opacity:.8}
/* BOLDER EDITORIAL PASS */
.field-notes-page{background:#fffdf9;position:relative}.field-notes-page::before{content:'OBSERVE · INTERPRET · QUESTION';position:absolute;right:2.5rem;top:5rem;writing-mode:vertical-rl;color:rgba(15,61,62,.15);font-size:.55rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em}.field-notes-layout{gap:44px}.note-feature{border-radius:0 42px 0 42px;padding:48px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f3d3e 0%,#164e4d 70%,#245d5a 100%);color:#fff;box-shadow:16px 16px 0 rgba(245,130,32,.85)}.note-feature h2,.note-feature .lead{color:#fff}.note-feature .note-meta{color:rgba(255,255,255,.68)}.note-feature .article-teaser{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16)}.note-feature .note-footer{border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.18);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7)}.note-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:22px}.note-card{min-height:250px;border:0;border-top:5px solid var(--green);border-radius:0 24px 0 24px;padding:28px;background:#f3eee7}.note-card:nth-child(1){background:#e8f0ec}.note-card:nth-child(2){background:#f8e4cf}.note-card:nth-child(3){background:#eee7d2}.note-card:nth-child(4){background:#fffdf9}.note-card:nth-child(1){transform:rotate(1deg)}.note-card:nth-child(2){transform:rotate(-1deg)}.note-card:nth-child(3){transform:rotate(-.7deg)}.note-card:nth-child(4){transform:rotate(1.1deg)}.note-card:hover{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(0)}.note-index{font-size:3.5rem}.note-card h3{font-size:1.45rem}.notes-bottom{background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--green-deep),var(--green));padding:95px 0}.notes-bottom .section-kicker{color:var(--orange)}
@media(max-width:800px){.field-notes-page::before{display:none}.note-feature{padding:30px;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 rgba(245,130,32,.75)}.note-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.note-card:nth-child(1),.note-card:nth-child(2),.note-card:nth-child(3),.note-card:nth-child(4){transform:none}.note-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px)}.notes-bottom{padding:65px 0}}
.notes-hero{isolation:isolate;min-height:430px;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(7,42,43,.76) 0%,rgba(15,61,62,.48) 36%,rgba(15,61,62,.08) 76%,rgba(15,61,62,.04) 100%),url('/images/field-notes.png');background-position:center;background-size:cover}
.notes-hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:-1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(7,42,43,.1),transparent 45%,rgba(7,42,43,.24))}
.notes-hero .container{position:relative;z-index:1}
.notes-hero .section-kicker{color:#f6c28f}
.notes-hero h1{color:#fff}
.notes-hero .muted{max-width:600px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86)}
</style>